---
// The one call to action on every Journey B page, and it is a quote and not a
// booking. Rule 3 of plan section 1.1a: a stranger comparing IT providers
// will not give up half an hour before they know roughly what it costs.
//
// It is a component, not a block on each page, because there are three
// Journey B pages and one quote ask (XFO-68). Copied three times, the three
// would drift.
//
// It is the managed IT enquiry form from XFO-46 (XFO-78). It posts to
// POST /api/enquiry with journey "managed-it", which creates a Lead in
// Dynamics 365, and public/assets/js/enquiry-form.js drives it. The fields
// match the managed IT form on /contact-us. Change one, change both: the
// Worker refuses a post that is missing a required field.
//
// Five answers beyond name, company and email. The number of offices is not
// padding. The price has a per-site fee in it (XFO-67), so a quote cannot be
// worked out from a headcount alone.
//
// The form needs JavaScript, because Turnstile does. The <noscript> block and
// the line under the form give the phone number and the email address, so this
// buyer never hits a dead end. Buyers get hello@; support@ is for customers
// raising a ticket (XFO-46).
//
// data-form-name is the same as on /contact-us, so the analytics funnel counts
// both. The page URL on the event tells them apart.
---

<section class="clean-block clean-form" id="quote" aria-labelledby="quote-heading">
	<div class="container">
		<div class="block-heading">
			<h2 id="quote-heading" class="text-info">Get a price for your business</h2>
			<p>You get a figure, not a sales process. If we are not the right fit we will say so.</p>
		</div>
		<div class="quote-ask">
			<p>Give us these five answers and we will come back with a monthly price, not a meeting request.</p>
			<form data-enquiry-form data-journey="managed-it" data-form-name="enquiry-managed-it" novalidate>
				<input type="hidden" name="journey" value="managed-it">
				<div class="honeypot" aria-hidden="true">
					<label for="quote-website">Website</label>
					<input type="text" id="quote-website" name="website" tabindex="-1" autocomplete="off">
				</div>
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-name">Your name</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="text" id="quote-name" name="name" required
							maxlength="100" autocomplete="name">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="name"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-company">Company</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="text" id="quote-company" name="company" required
							maxlength="100" autocomplete="organization">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="company"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-email">Work email</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="email" id="quote-email" name="email" required
							maxlength="120" autocomplete="email">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="email"></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-sm-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-users">How many people need support?</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="number" id="quote-users" name="users" required
							min="1" max="10000" step="1" inputmode="numeric">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="users"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-sm-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-offices">How many offices do they sit in?</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="number" id="quote-offices" name="offices" required
							min="1" max="500" step="1" inputmode="numeric">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="offices"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-sm-4 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-devices">How many computers, laptops and servers?</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="number" id="quote-devices" name="devices" required
							min="1" max="20000" step="1" inputmode="numeric">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="devices"></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="row">
					<div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-provider">Who looks after your IT today?</label>
						<input class="form-control" type="text" id="quote-provider" name="current_provider"
							maxlength="100" placeholder="A provider, somebody in-house, or nobody yet.">
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="current_provider"></div>
					</div>
					<div class="col-md-6 mb-3">
						<label class="form-label" for="quote-cover">What hours do you need covered?</label>
						<select class="form-select" id="quote-cover" name="cover" required>
							<option value="">Please choose…</option>
							<option value="Business hours">Business hours, Monday to Friday</option>
							<option value="Extended hours">Extended hours, early and late</option>
							<option value="24/7">24 hours, every day</option>
							<option value="Not sure">Not sure — tell me what is normal</option>
						</select>
						<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="cover"></div>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="mb-3" data-turnstile></div>
				<div class="form-check mb-3">
					<input class="form-check-input" type="checkbox" value="yes" name="consent"
						id="quote-consent" required>
					<label class="form-check-label" for="quote-consent">I am happy for XFour to reply to
						me about this enquiry. See our <a href="/legal/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</label>
					<div class="invalid-feedback d-block" data-error-for="consent"></div>
				</div>
				<button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg" type="submit">Get my price</button>
				<noscript>
					<p class="mt-3 mb-0">This form needs JavaScript. Please call
						<a href="tel:+441183702920">0118 370 2920</a> or email
						<a href="mailto:hello@xfour.co.uk">hello@xfour.co.uk</a> and ask for a managed IT
						quote instead.</p>
				</noscript>
			</form>
			<div class="enquiry-state ok" data-state="success" hidden>
				<h3 class="h5">Thank you — that is with us.</h3>
				<p class="mb-0">You will get an email confirming we have it, and one of us will come back to
					you with a price within one working day.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="enquiry-state bad" data-state="error" hidden>
				<p class="mb-0">Sorry — we could not send that. Please try again, or call
					<a href="tel:+441183702920">0118 370 2920</a> or email
					<a href="mailto:hello@xfour.co.uk">hello@xfour.co.uk</a>.</p>
			</div>
			<div class="enquiry-state bad" data-state="fallback" hidden>
				<p class="mb-0">This form is not available right now. Please call
					<a href="tel:+441183702920">0118 370 2920</a> or email
					<a href="mailto:hello@xfour.co.uk">hello@xfour.co.uk</a> and ask for a managed IT quote.</p>
			</div>
			<p class="rather-talk mb-0">
				Rather talk? Call <a href="tel:+441183702920">0118 370 2920</a> or email
				<a href="mailto:hello@xfour.co.uk">hello@xfour.co.uk</a>.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>
<script is:inline defer src="/assets/js/enquiry-form.js"></script>

<style>
	/* The theme caps .block-heading p at 420px, which is too narrow here. */
	.block-heading p {
		max-width: 680px;
	}

	.quote-ask {
		max-width: 760px;
		margin: 0 auto;
	}

	.quote-ask p {
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.rather-talk {
		margin-top: 1.5rem;
		color: #6c757d;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}

	/* The honeypot must be reachable by a bot reading the markup and invisible
	   to a person. Moving it off-screen does both; display:none is skipped by
	   some form-filling bots. */
	.honeypot {
		position: absolute;
		left: -10000px;
		width: 1px;
		height: 1px;
		overflow: hidden;
	}

	.enquiry-state {
		border-radius: 6px;
		padding: 24px;
	}

	.enquiry-state.ok {
		background-color: #e7f3ff;
		border: 1px solid #b6daff;
	}

	.enquiry-state.bad {
		background-color: #fdf0ef;
		border: 1px solid #f5c6c3;
	}
</style>
